@startuml

actor User

rectangle "Extension Components" {
  component "Background Script" as Background
  component "Content Script" as Content
  component "Popup UI" as Popup
  component "Data Control UI" as DataControl
  component "Image Processing Iframe" as ImageIframe
}

cloud "Remote Services" {
  database "Faircado CMS API" as CmsApi
  database "Faircado Catalog Service API" as CatalogApi
  database "Mixpanel API" as MixpanelApi
  rectangle "External Web App (Faircado)" as FaircadoWebApp
}

rectangle "Browser Storage" {
  database "Chrome Storage (Local/Sync)" as ChromeStorage
  database "Session Storage" as SessionStorage
}
ectangle "External Websites" as ExternalSites

User --> Popup : Clicks icon
User --> DataControl : Interacts with UI
User --> ExternalSites : Clicks external links

' Manifest declared connections
Background <--> ChromeStorage : Manages extension state

' Content script injection and communication
Background --> Content : Injects script
Content <--> Background : Chrome Runtime Messages
Content <--> ImageIframe : window.postMessage (image data)
Content <--> Content : window.postMessage (navigation-events.js)

' Data Control UI interactions
DataControl <--> Background : Chrome Runtime Messages (activate/uninstall)

' Popup UI interactions
Popup <--> Background : Chrome Runtime Messages (localization, recommendations)

' Network calls from Background Script
Background --> CmsApi : Fetch configs/heuristics/ab-tests
Background --> CatalogApi : Check supported websites
Background --> MixpanelApi : Track events/user profiles
Background --> FaircadoWebApp : Set uninstall URL

' Network calls from Content Script (indirectly via Background)
Content --> CmsApi : Requests (via Background)
Content --> CatalogApi : Requests (via Background)

' Storage interactions
Background <--> ChromeStorage : Read/Write (Auth, Machine Key, Cached Data, AB Tests)
Background <--> SessionStorage : Read/Write (Internal, AB Test Redirect Data)
Content <--> SessionStorage : Read/Write (FAIRCADO_EXT_SETTINGS)
FaircadoWebApp <--> SessionStorage : Read/Write (FAIRCADO_EXT_SETTINGS, Redirection Data)

' External links in UI
Popup --> ExternalSites : Amazon, Goodreads
DataControl --> FaircadoWebApp : Download, About

@enduml